<Layout title="Body Image & Sexual Confidence Test | SHYM356.ORG">
	<div class="arch">
		<button class="lang-toggle" id="lang-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleLang()">English</button>
		<div class="eyebrow"><span class="t-ar">نفسي</span><span class="t-en">Psychological</span> · <span class="t-ar">اختبارات نفسية وسلوكية للمتزوجين</span><span class="t-en">Psychological & Behavioral Tests for Married Couples</span></div>
		<h1><span class="t-ar">اختبار صورة الجسد والثقة الجنسية</span><span class="t-en">Body Image & Sexual Confidence Test</span></h1>
		<p class="en">Body Image & Sexual Confidence Test</p>
		<a href="/psychological-tests" class="backlink"><span class="t-ar">↩ العودة لكل الاختبارات</span><span class="t-en">↩ Back to all tests</span></a>
	</div>

	<div class="wrap">
		<div id="intro-section">
			<div class="card">
				<h2 class="section-title"><span class="t-ar">ما الهدف من هذا الاختبار؟</span><span class="t-en">What is the goal of this test?</span></h2>
				<p><span class="t-ar">كثير من الرجال والنساء يربطون بين جاذبيتهم ومدى نجاحهم في العلاقة الجنسية. بعض الناس يشعرون أنهم "غير كافيين" بسبب وزن أو طول أو شكل عضو أو حتى تجاعيد.</span><span class="t-en">Many men and women tie their attractiveness to how successful they feel in their sex life. Some people feel "not enough" because of weight, height, body shape, or even wrinkles.</span></p>
				<p><span class="t-ar">المشكلة أن هذه الفكرة قد تصنع حاجزًا نفسيًا يضعف المتعة حتى لو لم يكن هناك أي عائق جسدي حقيقي. هذا الاختبار يساعدك تفهم: هل أنت راضٍ عن نفسك وجسدك؟ أم تحتاج إصلاح الصورة التي تراها في المرآة قبل أن تدخل السرير؟</span><span class="t-en">The problem is that this idea can create a psychological barrier that weakens pleasure even when there's no real physical obstacle at all. This test helps you understand: are you satisfied with yourself and your body? Or do you need to repair the image you see in the mirror before getting into bed?</span></p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h2 class="section-title"><span class="t-ar">الفائدة المرجوة</span><span class="t-en">Expected benefit</span></h2>
				<ul class="benefits">
					<li><span class="t-ar">يكشف إن كانت صورتك عن جسدك تؤثر سلبًا على رغبتك ومتعتك الجنسية.</span><span class="t-en">Reveals whether your body image is negatively affecting your sexual desire and pleasure.</span></li>
					<li><span class="t-ar">يساعدك على التمييز بين القلق من المظهر والقلق الحقيقي من الأداء.</span><span class="t-en">Helps you distinguish between appearance-anxiety and genuine performance concerns.</span></li>
					<li><span class="t-ar">يفتح الطريق أمام تدريبات عملية لتعزيز تقدير الذات والثقة بالجسد.</span><span class="t-en">Opens the way for practical exercises to build self-esteem and body confidence.</span></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h2 class="section-title"><span class="t-ar">طريقة الإجابة</span><span class="t-en">How to answer</span></h2>
				<p style="font-size:14.5px"><span class="t-ar">اختر الإجابة التي تعكس حالتك غالبًا.</span><span class="t-en">Choose the answer that usually reflects your state.</span></p>
				<div class="disclaimer"><b><span class="t-ar">تنبيه:</span><span class="t-en">Note:</span></b> <span class="t-ar">هذا الاختبار مبني على مقاييس متعارف عليها عالميًا لأغراض التوعية الذاتية فقط، وليس بديلاً عن الفحص أو التشخيص الطبي. إذا كانت النتيجة تشير إلى وجود مشكلة، يُرجى استشارة طبيب مختص (طب ذكورة/نساء أو معالج جنسي) قبل اتخاذ أي قرار.</span><span class="t-en">This test is based on internationally recognized scales for self-awareness purposes only, and is not a substitute for medical examination or diagnosis. If your result suggests a possible problem, please consult a qualified physician (urologist/gynecologist or a sex therapist) before making any decisions.</span></div>
				<button class="start-btn" onclick="startQuiz()"><span class="t-ar">ابدأ الاختبار (15 سؤالاً)</span><span class="t-en">Start the test (15 questions)</span></button>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="quiz-section" class="card">
			<div class="progress-wrap">
				<div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div></div>
				<div class="progress-label" id="progress-label"><span class="t-ar">تمت الإجابة على 0 سؤال</span><span class="t-en">Answered 0 questions</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="questions-list"></div>
			<button class="submit-btn" onclick="submitQuiz()"><span class="t-ar">عرض النتيجة</span><span class="t-en">Show my result</span></button>
		</div>

		<div id="result-section" class="card">
			<h2 class="section-title"><span class="t-ar">نتيجتك</span><span class="t-en">Your result</span></h2>
			<div class="result-content"></div>
			<div class="disclaimer"><b><span class="t-ar">تنبيه:</span><span class="t-en">Note:</span></b> <span class="t-ar">هذا الاختبار مبني على مقاييس متعارف عليها عالميًا لأغراض التوعية الذاتية فقط، وليس بديلاً عن الفحص أو التشخيص الطبي. إذا كانت النتيجة تشير إلى وجود مشكلة، يُرجى استشارة طبيب مختص (طب ذكورة/نساء أو معالج جنسي) قبل اتخاذ أي قرار.</span><span class="t-en">This test is based on internationally recognized scales for self-awareness purposes only, and is not a substitute for medical examination or diagnosis. If your result suggests a possible problem, please consult a qualified physician (urologist/gynecologist or a sex therapist) before making any decisions.</span></div>
			<button class="reset-btn" onclick="resetQuiz()"><span class="t-ar">إعادة الاختبار</span><span class="t-en">Retake the test</span></button>
		</div>

		<footer class="site-footer">
			<p><span class="t-ar">من سلسلة "التدريبات العملية لتحسين العلاقة الزوجية"</span><span class="t-en">From the "Practical Exercises to Improve Your Marital Relationship" series</span></p>
			<p><a href="/psychological-tests/anxiety-stress"><span class="t-ar">الاختبار السابق</span><span class="t-en">Previous test</span></a> · <a href="/psychological-tests"><span class="t-ar">كل الاختبارات</span><span class="t-en">All tests</span></a> · <a href="/psychological-tests/love-languages"><span class="t-ar">الاختبار التالي</span><span class="t-en">Next test</span></a></p>
		</footer>
	</div>
</Layout>

<script>
function bi(ar, en){
  return '<span class="t-ar">'+ar+'</span><span class="t-en">'+(en||ar)+'</span>';
}

function setLang(lang){
  document.documentElement.setAttribute('lang', lang);
  document.documentElement.setAttribute('dir', lang==='en' ? 'ltr' : 'rtl');
  try{ localStorage.setItem('site_lang', lang); }catch(e){}
  var btn = document.getElementById('lang-toggle-btn');
  if(btn){ btn.textContent = (lang==='en') ? 'العربية' : 'English'; }
}

function toggleLang(){
  var cur = document.documentElement.getAttribute('lang') || 'ar';
  setLang(cur === 'en' ? 'ar' : 'en');
}

(function initLangOnLoad(){
  var saved = null;
  try{ saved = localStorage.getItem('site_lang'); }catch(e){}
  var initialLang = (saved === 'en' || saved === 'ar') ? saved : 'ar';
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){ setLang(initialLang); });
})();

function initQuiz(CONFIG){
  var answers = {};
  var qSection = document.getElementById('quiz-section');
  var introSection = document.getElementById('intro-section');
  var resultSection = document.getElementById('result-section');
  var progressFill = document.getElementById('progress-fill');
  var progressLabel = document.getElementById('progress-label');
  var total = CONFIG.questions.length;

  var currentLang = document.documentElement.getAttribute('lang') || 'ar';
  document.documentElement.setAttribute('lang', currentLang);
  document.documentElement.setAttribute('dir', currentLang==='en' ? 'ltr' : 'rtl');

  function progressText(n){
    return bi('تمت الإجابة على '+n+' من '+total+' سؤال', 'Answered '+n+' of '+total+' questions');
  }

  function renderQuestions(){
    var html = '';
    CONFIG.questions.forEach(function(q, i){
      html += '<div class="question" id="q-wrap-'+i+'">';
      html += '<div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">'+(i+1)+'</span><span>'+bi(q.text.ar, q.text.en)+'</span></div>';
      html += '<div class="options">';
      q.options.forEach(function(opt, oi){
        var checked = answers[i] === opt.v ? 'checked' : '';
        html += '<label class="opt" id="opt-'+i+'-'+oi+'">'+
                '<input type="radio" name="q'+i+'" value="'+opt.v+'" onchange="quizAnswer('+i+','+oi+','+opt.v+')" '+checked+'>'+
                '<span>'+bi(opt.label.ar, opt.label.en)+'</span></label>';
      });
      html += '</div></div>';
    });
    qSection.querySelector('.questions-list').innerHTML = html;

    Object.keys(answers).forEach(function(qIndex){
      var wrap = document.getElementById('q-wrap-'+qIndex);
      if(wrap){
        var opts = wrap.querySelectorAll('.opt');
        opts.forEach(function(o){ o.classList.remove('checked'); });
        var selectedOpt = wrap.querySelector('input[value="'+answers[qIndex]+'"]');
        if(selectedOpt){
          selectedOpt.parentElement.classList.add('checked');
          wrap.classList.remove('missing');
        }
      }
    });
  }

  (window as any).quizAnswer = function(qIndex: any, optIndex: any, value: any){
    answers[qIndex] = value;
    var wrap = document.getElementById('q-wrap-'+qIndex);
    var opts = wrap.querySelectorAll('.opt');
    opts.forEach(function(o){ o.classList.remove('checked'); });
    document.getElementById('opt-'+qIndex+'-'+optIndex).classList.add('checked');
    wrap.classList.remove('missing');
    updateProgress();
  };

  function updateProgress(){
    var answered = Object.keys(answers).length;
    var pct = Math.round((answered/total)*100);
    progressFill.style.width = pct+'%';
    progressLabel.innerHTML = progressText(answered);
  }

  (window as any).startQuiz = function(){
    introSection.style.display = 'none';
    qSection.style.display = 'block';
    window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:'smooth'});
  };

  (window as any).submitQuiz = function(){
    var missing = [];
    for(var i=0;i<total;i++){
      if(!(i in answers)) missing.push(i);
    }
    if(missing.length){
      var first = document.getElementById('q-wrap-'+missing[0]);
      missing.forEach(function(i){
        document.getElementById('q-wrap-'+i).classList.add('missing');
      });
      first.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth', block:'center'});
      return;
    }
    computeAndShowResult();
  };

  function groupTotal(groupName){
    var sum = 0;
    CONFIG.questions.forEach(function(q,i){
      if((q.group||'main') === groupName) sum += answers[i];
    });
    return sum;
  }

  function pickBand(score, bands){
    for(var i=0;i<bands.length;i++){
      var b = bands[i];
      if(score >= b.min && score <= b.max) return b;
    }
    return bands[bands.length-1];
  }

  function computeAndShowResult(){
    var html = '';
    if(CONFIG.mode === 'category'){
      var sums = {};
      Object.keys(CONFIG.categories).forEach(function(k){ sums[k]=0; });
      CONFIG.questions.forEach(function(q,i){ sums[q.group] += answers[i]; });
      var winner = null, winnerScore = -1;
      Object.keys(sums).forEach(function(k){
        if(sums[k] > winnerScore){ winnerScore = sums[k]; winner = k; }
      });
      var cat = CONFIG.categories[winner];
      html += '<div class="result-badge high"><span class="label">'+bi(cat.label.ar,cat.label.en)+'</span></div>';
      html += '<div class="result-text">'+bi(cat.text.ar,cat.text.en)+'</div>';
      html += '<div class="training-box"><b>'+bi('خطوة عملية مقترحة','Practical suggested step')+'</b>'+bi(cat.training.ar,cat.training.en)+'</div>';
      if(CONFIG.showBreakdown){
        html += '<div class="training-box"><b>'+bi('توزيع نقاطك على اللغات الخمس','Your score breakdown across the five languages')+'</b><ul style="margin:6px 0 0;padding-right:18px">';
        Object.keys(CONFIG.categories).forEach(function(k){
          html += '<li>'+bi(CONFIG.categories[k].label.ar, CONFIG.categories[k].label.en)+': '+sums[k]+'</li>';
        });
        html += '</ul></div>';
      }
    } else if(CONFIG.mode === 'grouped_sum'){
      var overall = 0;
      var breakdownHtml = '';
      Object.keys(CONFIG.groups).forEach(function(g){
        var raw = groupTotal(g);
        var weight = CONFIG.groups[g].weight || 1;
        var val = raw * weight;
        overall += val;
        if(CONFIG.groups[g].label){
          breakdownHtml += '<li>'+bi(CONFIG.groups[g].label.ar, CONFIG.groups[g].label.en)+': '+ (Math.round(val*100)/100) +'</li>';
        }
      });
      overall = Math.round(overall*100)/100;
      var band = pickBand(overall, CONFIG.bands);
      html += '<div class="result-badge '+band.cls+'"><span class="score">'+overall+'</span><span class="label">'+bi(band.label.ar,band.label.en)+'</span></div>';
      html += '<div class="result-text">'+bi(band.text.ar,band.text.en)+'</div>';
      if(band.training && (band.training.ar || band.training.en)){
        html += '<div class="training-box"><b>'+bi('خطوة عملية مقترحة','Practical suggested step')+'</b>'+bi(band.training.ar,band.training.en)+'</div>';
      }
      if(CONFIG.showBreakdown && breakdownHtml){
        html += '<div class="training-box"><b>'+bi('تفصيل حسب المحاور','Breakdown by domain')+'</b><ul style="margin:6px 0 0;padding-right:18px">'+breakdownHtml+'</ul></div>';
      }
      if(CONFIG.specialBand){
        var sgRaw = groupTotal(CONFIG.specialBand.group);
        var sband = pickBand(sgRaw, CONFIG.specialBand.bands);
        html += '<div class="training-box"><b>'+bi(CONFIG.specialBand.label.ar,CONFIG.specialBand.label.en)+' ('+sgRaw+')</b>'+bi(sband.text.ar,sband.text.en)+'</div>';
      }
    } else {
      var score = groupTotal('main');
      var band = pickBand(score, CONFIG.bands);
      html += '<div class="result-badge '+band.cls+'"><span class="score">'+score+'</span><span class="label">'+bi(band.label.ar,band.label.en)+'</span></div>';
      html += '<div class="result-text">'+bi(band.text.ar,band.text.en)+'</div>';
      if(band.training && (band.training.ar || band.training.en)){
        html += '<div class="training-box"><b>'+bi('خطوة عملية مقترحة','Practical suggested step')+'</b>'+bi(band.training.ar,band.training.en)+'</div>';
      }
    }
    resultSection.querySelector('.result-content').innerHTML = html;
    qSection.style.display = 'none';
    resultSection.style.display = 'block';
    window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:'smooth'});
  }

  (window as any).resetQuiz = function(){
    answers = {};
    resultSection.style.display = 'none';
    introSection.style.display = 'block';
    renderQuestions();
    updateProgress();
    window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:'smooth'});
  };

  renderQuestions();
  updateProgress();
}

